                                "sense_id": "cbd023a6-23d7-33c5-9090-7476b3e5d295",
                                "text": "“My gentle spirit is roused to the accomplishment of great things. I feel in me a valiance, an inspiration. I am no vulgar seller of aguardiente, like Domingo. I was born to be the capataz of the Lugarenos.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11bc3e94-9d70-4f14-83ae-9494f5c743d4",
                                "sense_id": "cbd023a6-23d7-33c5-9090-7476b3e5d295",
                                "text": "The capataz of the batey gang, a tall flushed Jamaican negro, passed on a cantering white pony."
                            }
